# SPIDER's drum pads and note repeat (app/smk37.c; seq.c rp_*): pads 9-16 the kit's first eight sounds whatever track
# is selected; NOTE REPEAT (the FM-1's LFO button) tapped: repeat on / off (the page stays); held + a top pad: its
# rate (and on); held alone and let go: the LFO page. A drum pad held repeats (stopped: from the hit, every period; at
# 120 BPM a sixteenth is 125 ms); while recording the repeats are recorded into the kit, whatever track is selected
wait 300
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect trk 1
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
# a synth selected (T2): pads 9 and 10 play the kit (T1): its kick and snare
expect drumhits 0
tappad 8 90
expect drumhits 1
tappad 9 90
expect drumhits 2
pads
# NOTE REPEAT tapped: on, the page stays; a pad held 520 ms: its hit and four sixteenths
bpm 120
tap LFO
wait 40
expect page Arrange
pad 8 100
wait 40
pads
wait 480
pad 8 0
wait 40
expect drumhits 7
# held + pad 6 (the top row's sixth): 1/32, on; let go: no tap, no LFO page; 520 ms: a hit and eight
press LFO
wait 40
pads
tappad 5
wait 40
release LFO
wait 40
expect page Arrange
pad 9 100
wait 520
pad 9 0
wait 40
expect drumhits 16
# tapped again: off; a pad held is one hit
tap LFO
wait 40
pad 10 100
wait 520
pad 10 0
wait 40
expect drumhits 17
# recording (REC + PLAY), repeat on at 1/16, T2 still selected: the snare held lands on the kit's steps in a row (the
# hit just past step 1's middle: quantised onto step 2; the repeats on the grid after it)
tap LFO
wait 40
press LFO
tappad 3
release LFO
wait 40
press REC
tap PLAY
release REC
expect playing 1
wait 20
pad 9 100
wait 470
pad 9 0
wait 300
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect note 1 1 1 0
expect note 1 1 2 2
expect note 1 1 3 2
expect note 1 1 4 2
expect note 1 1 5 2
expect note 1 1 6 0
expect trk 2
# held alone and let go: the LFO page
tap LFO
wait 40
press LFO
wait 600
release LFO
wait 40
expect page LFO
# on Steps (SEQ), KNOB BANK: live pads, the drums (no step written by a pad)
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 1
smktap KNOBBANK
wait 40
expect pads_drums 1
tappad 12 100
expect note 1 1 13 0
pads
